			"notes": "## What's new\n\n• **Armor Sleeves Fixed** → Chestplate sleeves no longer tear off and float in front of your camera in third person\n\nFixed on: `Forge 1.20.1`, `Fabric 1.20.1`, `Fabric 1.21.x`\n\n• **Starcatcher: Fishing Rod Animations** → Modded rods no longer freeze in first person; casting and reeling now animate smoothly\n\nFixed on: `Forge 1.20.1`, `NeoForge 1.21.1`\n\n• **Carry On Everywhere** → the floating arm while carrying blocks and mobs is patched in every single build now\n\nSupported on: `All versions`\n\n• **Quick Charge Scaling** → Animations now speed up properly with the enchantment instead of snapping at the end\n\nFixed on: `All versions`\n\n• **True Invisibility** → First-person arms now properly hide while the effect is active\n\nFixed on: `All versions`\n\n• **Fabric 1.21.5 Support** → Fresh **1.21.x** build covering `Fabric 1.21.1`, `1.21.5` and `1.21.11`\n\n**2,222+ downloads** across Modrinth and CurseForge → huge thanks to everyone!\n\n| File | Loader | Minecraft |\n|---|---|---|\n| `dont-punch-my-tacz-v0.5.2-1.20.1-fabric.jar` | Fabric | 1.20.1 |\n| `dont-punch-my-tacz-v0.5.2-1.21.x-fabric.jar` | Fabric | 1.21.1, 1.21.5, 1.21.11 |\n| `dont-punch-my-tacz-v0.5.2-26.x-fabric.jar` | Fabric | 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, 26.2, 26.3 |\n| `dont-punch-my-tacz-v0.5.2-1.20.1-forge.jar` | Forge | 1.20.1 |\n| `dont-punch-my-tacz-v0.5.2-1.21.1-neo.jar` | NeoForge | 1.21.1 |"
