			"notes": "## What's new\n\n- **Carry On support** → carrying a chest, barrel or animal in first person no longer shows a floating bare hand next to it, you just see what you're carrying. Carry On stays completely optional, nothing changes without it\n\n- **Vanilla brush fix** → the brush got its sweeping animation back\n\n- **Create: Gunsmithing support** → flintlock, revolver, shotgun, nailgun, gatling, blazegun, launcher, hammer and frag grenade no longer double-render\n\n- **One jar for all of 26.x** → the file now says it out loud: 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, 26.2 and 26.3 all use the same jar, no more picking the exact version\n\nPunchy still ships separate jars per MC version → make sure you grab the Punchy build that matches yours"
